               0010,0010 = tag00100010) verified from DICOMSerializer.renameAttrToTag()
               (server/src/.../plugins/datatypes/dicom/DICOMSerializer.java).

               A2 RESOLVED (18.3-02, runtime-validated): plain assignment — both
               msg['tag00100010'] = '...' and msg.tag00100010 = '...' — REPLACES the whole
               E4X element node in this Rhino version, silently dropping its tag/vr/len
               attributes. DICOMSerializer.fromXML()'s renameTagToAttr() only renames an
