               attributes) intact — confirmed live via a temporary channelMap dump of
               msg.toXMLString() before/after this step, since re-run as regression
               protection would live in DicomRoundTripTest rather than this fixture. -->
          <script>msg.tag00100010.setChildren('RoundTripPatient');
channelMap.put('patientName', 'RoundTripPatient');</script>
